               <msContents>
                  <summary>Hebrew Bible: Pentateuch</summary>
                  <msItem>
                     <title xml:lang="he" key="work_2">תורה</title>
                     <title xml:lang="he-Latn-x-lc" key="work_2">Torah</title>
                     <textLang mainLang="he">Hebrew</textLang>
                     <note>The beginning of the text is defective. Begins from halfway through
                        Genesis 27:30.</note>
                     <note>Theere are some peculiarities in the use of vocalisation and cantillation
                        marks (see article by Díez-Macho cited below).</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
